description":"Settle into the hotel and prepare for the next exciting days in San Francisco.","start_time":"13:00","end_time":"14:00","duration_hours":1},{"name":"Exploring North Beach and Italian Heritage","location":"North Beach, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-14","description":"Discover the Italian heritage of San Francisco by walking through North Beach, enjoying local cuisine and atmospheres.","start_time":"14:30","end_time":"17:30","duration_hours":3},{"name":"Dinner at The Stinking Rose","location":"326 Columbus Ave, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-14","description":"Experience unique garlic-flavored dishes at this quirky restaurant that embraces the garlic theme.","start_time":"18:00","end_time":"20:00","duration_hours":2},{"name":"Visit Golden Gate Park","location":"San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-15","description":"Enjoy the sprawling urban park with stunning views, gardens, and walking trails ideal for exploring in leisure.","start_time":"09:00","end_time":"12:00","duration_hours":3},{"name":"Lunch at Park Chalet","location":"1000 Great Hwy, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-15","description":"Savor tasty meals with scenic views of the ocean in a relaxed pub atmosphere.","start_time":"12:30","end_time":"14:00","duration_hours":1.5},{"name":"Golden Gate Bridge Walk","location":"Golden Gate Bridge, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-15","description":"Walk across the iconic Golden Gate Bridge, enjoying breathtaking views of the bay and cityscape.","start_time":"14:30","end_time":"16:00","duration_hours":1.5},{"name":"Dinner at Waterbar","location":"399 The Embarcadero, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-15","description":"Enjoy exquisite seafood and amazing views of the bay at this waterfront restaurant.","start_time":"16:30","end_time":"18:30","duration_hours":2},{"name":"Jazz Fest at SF Jazz Center","location":"201 Franklin St, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-16","description":"Join the local celebration of jazz music as part of the SF Jazz 