ws of the San Francisco skyline and bay.","start_time":"13:30","end_time":"15:00","duration_hours":1.5},{"name":"Return to San Francisco and Evening at Pier 39","location":"Pier 39, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-18","description":"Explore the lively Pier 39 area, viewing sea lions and grabbing last-minute souvenirs with entertainment options.","start_time":"15:30","end_time":"18:30","duration_hours":3},{"name":"Dinner at Crustacean","location":"1475 Polk St, San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-18","description":"Experience delicious Vietnamese and fusion cuisine in a classy setting, featuring house specialties.","start_time":"19:00","end_time":"21:00","duration_hours":2},{"name":"Final Day in San Francisco with City Exploration","location":"San Francisco, CA","date":"2025-06-19","description":"Spend your last day enjoying the sights and sounds of the city, visiting any spots missed earlier or revisiting favorites.","start_time":"09:00","end_time":"17:00","duration_hours":8},{"name":"Evening Flight return to New York","location":"SFO Airport","date":"2025-06-20","description":"Depart San Francisco and fly back to New York, concluding your memorable trip.","start_time":"18:00","end_time":"21:00","duration_hours":3}]}[00m


